     "nota": "",
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Places that «stay»: ficar",
     "texto": [
      "For things that do not move (buildings, cities, countries) the most natural choice is **ficar**: **Onde fica o banco?** (where is the bank?), **Lisboa fica em Portugal**.",
      "For people and things that move, **estar**: O gato **está** na sala."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "On top, under, beside",
     "texto": [
      "These expressions take **de**, which merges with the article: de + o = **do**, de + a = **da**.",
      "**Em cima da** mesa (on top of the table), **debaixo do** sofá (under the sofa), **ao lado do** banco (next to the bank), **dentro da** mala (inside the bag), **em frente do** sofá (opposite the sofa), **atrás da** porta (behind the door).",
      "**Entre** goes without «de»: entre o banco e a escola."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
